{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0110_doctor_01",
      "hash": "484df45b107f77ec",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「哦哦！[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n[VAR POKNAME(0002)]的狀況如何啊？"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0110_doctor_14",
      "hash": "484a735b107c66e2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……嗯？嗯嗯！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0110_doctor_02",
      "hash": "484df75b107f7d05",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「哦～！\\n[VAR POKNAME(0002)]已經完全把自己\\r\\n當成是[VAR TRNAME(0000)][VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的搭檔了！\\c\\n看來[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳很有訓練家的才能啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0110_doctor_03",
      "hash": "484df65b107f7b52",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……什麼？\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳有東西要給我？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0110_sys_01",
      "hash": "4167fe4e820569e0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]把包裹\\n交給了大木博士！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0110_doctor_04",
      "hash": "484df15b107f72d3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「哦哦，已經到啦！\\n這是我跟他們訂的東西！\\r\\n真是謝謝[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p12_t001_r0301",
      "hash": "83d2cff374bc37f6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p13_t001_r0301",
      "hash": "aaddc4c56bc5382b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0110_rival_01",
      "hash": "0af935fdb5aacddf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「大木博士～！\\n教我的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]學招式……"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0110_rival_02",
      "hash": "0af936fdb5aacf92",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「哇！[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳這是什麼狀況！好厲害！！\\r\\n[VAR POKNAME(0002)]竟然騎在[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳身上！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0110_doctor_05",
      "hash": "484df05b107f7120",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「是[VAR TRNAME(0001)]啊！\\n你來得正好！\\c\\n我剛剛收到了好東西！\\n就送給你們吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0110_sys_02",
      "hash": "4168014e82056ef9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從大木博士那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]蔓莓果[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0110_rival_03",
      "hash": "0af937fdb5aad145",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「看起來好好吃喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0110_doctor_06",
      "hash": "484df35b107f7639",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「不行不行！\\n那是給寶可夢吃的東西！\\c\\n捕捉寶可夢的時候……\\c\\n如果在投精靈球之前\\n先丟出蔓莓果的話，\\r\\n寶可夢就會變得很開心，\\r\\n這樣一來就更容易捉到囉！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0110_rival_04",
      "hash": "0af930fdb5aac560",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「……好險啊！\\n我差點就要把它吃掉了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0110_doctor_07",
      "hash": "484df25b107f7486",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「你們兩個聽好了！\\n不管是要去捉更多的寶可夢，\\r\\n還是專心培育自己中意的寶可夢\\r\\n都是你們的自由！\\c\\n重要的是要樂在其中喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0110_rival_05",
      "hash": "0af931fdb5aac713",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「我要捉\\n好多好多的寶可夢！\\c\\n不只如此，\\n我還想把牠們訓練得更強！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0110_doctor_08",
      "hash": "484dfd5b107f8737",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「希望[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳能與\\n更多的寶可夢相遇！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0110_max",
      "hash": "5c8d354eeb052d05"
    }
  ]
}
